      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "My old home PV system was about 15 years old, and while ouputting well in Spring/Summer, was a bit hit and miss in the colder seasons. Solar Quotes organized 3 quotes for me and mostly they used the same hardware (panels, inverters, etc...). I also obtained my own quote and ultimately used them instead - same hardware, cheaper price. The supplier had missed out on previous PV install quotes on 2 other occasions, so I gave them a 3rd chance to win the job. While the installation is yet to happen, and has been delayed a few weeks, and their communication has been less than ideal, I am comfortable enough with the overall process and technology that I am happy to wear the slight inconvenience in delayed install timing. My new system is a 10kW 3 phase (monitored) vs the old 5kW 1 phase (un-monitored), so in no real hurry. We are doing the long term preparation for home and vehicle electrification slowly. The price difference was significant (more than 30% cheaper). As usual, Solar Quotes helped again. I have used their services and online guides for over 20 installs so far for family and friends.",
